1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,100
No waiter is coming. Now what?

2
00:00:02,100 --> 00:00:06,300
저기요! (jeogiyo!)
You just call out. Not rude here.

3
00:00:06,300 --> 00:00:11,100
띵동 (ttingdong)
Or press the bell on the table.

4
00:00:11,100 --> 00:00:15,700
이모! (imo!)
Regulars call the server "auntie".

5
00:00:15,700 --> 00:00:20,100
잘 먹겠습니다 (jal meokgetseumnida)
So, what would you shout? 👇
